{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"y":-31,"x":426,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara014_1","addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1a"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"timeBak":300,"x":426,"bright":1,"transTime":0,"y":-31,"nonStandBright":false,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara014_1","addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1a"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]卡夫那小子净长了块头，脑子忘记一块长了，一个不注意就会做些蠢事。老大你可得多盯着他点。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]这可不是我说他坏话，毕竟他那个样子……做起事来是真的不经思考。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]在村子的时候，三天两头要揪着他去跟人道歉。什么抢小孩玩具啊、大早上太阳都没出来就在村子空地喊操锻炼扰民啊，之类的事层出不穷。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]他说来老大营地做客的时候兴致可高了，我可不想看他在这边也整出什么幺蛾子。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"timeBak":300,"x":426,"bright":1,"transTime":0,"y":-31,"nonStandBright":false,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara014_1","addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1b"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"script":"yd_014_06-备份","des":"皮塔-关于卡夫1"}